# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Never ship the vendored tree into the build context. The `!**/*.go` rule above
# would otherwise pull vendor/**/*.go back in without vendor/modules.txt, so
# `go build` enters vendor mode with an incomplete vendor dir and fails with
# "inconsistent vendoring in /workspace". The image resolves modules via
# `go mod download` instead. `vendor/**` is required (not just `vendor`) to
# override the per-file .go re-include for nested paths.
vendor
vendor/**
